<title>USA: Lockport City SD, N.Y. won by First Albany [CORRECTED 15:57 GMT].</title>
<headline>Lockport City SD, N.Y. won by First Albany [CORRECTED 15:57 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corp said Tuesday it won $7 million of Lockport City School District, N.Y., general obligation school district bonds of 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.79 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects winner from Fleet Securities, Inc., and net interest cost from 4.8123 percent).</p>
